      "comment": "SI-193 (finding C44B-R1S-04, ruling D-78 item 5): the canvas's text editor (the element marked data-tt-field-kind=\"canvasText\"; the kernel's sensor textFieldKind) is a text field whose undo and redo chords belong to the document: they are not the field's and reach the keymap (edit.undo, edit.redo). Ordinary fields keep their own undo.",
